---
title: Downloads
pagetitle: Downloads
description: 'Downloads der Fahrschule Guth Bochum: Checkliste zur Auswahl der richtigen Fahrschule, Flyer und Unterlagen zum Führerschein mit 17.'
subnav: ueberuns
breadcrumb_parents:
  - { label: Über Uns, href: /ueberuns/ }
---
<%= partial "partials/page_header" %>
<section class="py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4">
    <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">Unsere <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-primary to-secondary bg-clip-text text-transparent">Downloads</span>!</h2>
    <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-sm"><ul class="divide-y divide-base-content/10">
      <% data.links.downloads.each do |d| %>
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-1 px-6 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <span class="font-semibold"><%= d.name %></span>
          <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm rounded-full" href="<%= d.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="<%= d.name %>"><%= icon :download, css: "size-4" %> Download</a>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul></div>
  </div>
</section>
